# WolkaraForever overlay: layer file, path in the prepared tree, and what it means.
#   replace - the pinned platform has this file and ours takes its place.
#   add     - the platform has no such path; ours is new.
# prepare.sh enforces both: a missing 'replace' destination, or an 'add' that
# collides with a path upstream now has, stops the build. An ingest therefore
# cannot silently drop our file or overwrite one of theirs.
#
# Regenerate with wolkaraforever/tools/overlay_map.sh after changing the layer.
#
